Hi all, I have dsms describing daily abundance for several avian species. Calculating abundance and uncertainty using dsm_varprop and dsm.var.gam has worked well for me. However in comparing my results to those of other studies I would like to be able to calculate an average abundance at time scales longer than just one day with an associated variance/confidence interval (because many studies just average abundance over the entire study period and do not take into account changes with respect to day of the year).

